description	"Paz Vizsla

A slow, Jetpack-equipped tank who converts damage into resource.

^2Weaponry:
- Wookiee-style Melee
- Vibroknife/Personal Energy Shield (Purple Saber)
-- Saber/Blaster Defense (3)
-- No BP Regen
-- 60% shorter
- M-55 Medium Repeating Blaster (Minigun 3)
-- 5% less damage
-- 5% less FP damage
-- 10% slower reload

^5Powers:
- Last Stand (Rage 3) ^3[CS4]

^8Attributes:
- Fury (2)
-- Regen: 1/.25s to 15
- Strength (2)
- Climate Shielding (1)
- Beskar (3)
- Blast Armor
- Brawler Guard
- Healing (1)
- 20% less knockback given
- 80% less knockback taken
- 30% slower skill cooldown

^3Abilities:
- Jetpack
- Wrist Flamethrower ^3[CS1]
- Shoulder Barge (1) ^3[Melee CS2]"